{"id":"level-up-2026-10-16","name":"2026-10-16 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1401","en":"We had to scrub the floor after the painting workshop.","zh":"绘画工作坊结束后，我们不得不用力擦洗地板。","note":"scrub · 用力擦洗，把…擦净；取消；矮树丛， 灌木丛 · scrub the floor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1402","en":"The survey used a relatively homogeneous group of university students.","zh":"这项调查使用了一组背景相对一致的大学生。","note":"homogeneous · 同种类的， 由相同事物组成的 · a homogeneous group","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1403","en":"Her grandfather's stories had a profound influence on her writing.","zh":"祖父讲的故事对她的写作产生了深远影响。","note":"profound · 深切的， 深远的； 知识渊博的， 见解深刻的， 深奥的 · a profound influence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1404","en":"Rain made the marble steps outside the museum dangerously slippery.","zh":"雨水使博物馆外的大理石台阶变得湿滑危险。","note":"marble · 大理石；弹子； · marble steps","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1405","en":"Please collate the results before our meeting on Friday.","zh":"请在周五开会前整理好结果。","note":"collate · 对照； 核对； 整理 · collate the results","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1406","en":"The researchers collected animal excreta for analysis in the laboratory.","zh":"研究人员收集动物排泄物，在实验室进行分析。","note":"excreta · 排泄物 · animal excreta","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1407","en":"The school does not condone cheating, even on informal tests.","zh":"学校不容忍作弊，即使是在非正式测验中。","note":"condone · 宽恕， 赦免； 纵容， 容忍 · condone cheating","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1408","en":"Opening a village library fulfilled her lifelong aspiration.","zh":"开办一家乡村图书馆实现了她毕生的愿望。","note":"aspiration · 强烈的愿望； 志向 · a lifelong aspiration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1409","en":"The clinic plans to computerize its appointment records next year.","zh":"这家诊所计划明年将预约记录电脑化。","note":"computerize · 使计算机化； 用计算机做； 用计算机储存 · computerize records","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1410","en":"Her illustrated books helped popularize science among younger readers.","zh":"她的图文书有助于向年轻读者普及科学。","note":"popularize · 宣扬， 宣传， 推广； 使普及， 使通俗化 · popularize science","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1411","en":"The small bridge cannot carry the weight of heavy trucks.","zh":"这座小桥承受不了重型卡车的重量。","note":"carry · 运送，搬运；传送， · carry a load","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1412","en":"The children burst into laughter when the puppet sneezed.","zh":"木偶打喷嚏时，孩子们突然大笑起来。","note":"burst · 爆炸；突然发作；破裂；爆炸 · burst into laughter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1413","en":"We returned from holiday to find an almost empty refrigerator.","zh":"我们度假回来，发现冰箱几乎空了。","note":"refrigerator · 冰箱； 冷藏库 · an empty refrigerator","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1414","en":"For these remote farms, a reliable vehicle is a necessity.","zh":"对这些偏远农场来说，可靠的交通工具是必需品。","note":"necessity · 必然， 必要； 必需品； 必要性 · a practical necessity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1415","en":"She chose a wooden frame for her grandmother's photograph.","zh":"她为祖母的照片选了一个木质相框。","note":"frame · 框架；给…镶框 · a wooden frame","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1416","en":"We need a larger venue for this year's graduation ceremony.","zh":"今年的毕业典礼需要一个更大的场地。","note":"venue · 地点 · a suitable venue","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1417","en":"The exhibition traces the origin of several familiar household objects.","zh":"这个展览追溯了几种常见家用物品的起源。","note":"origin · 起源； · the origin of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1418","en":"A clash of opinions delayed agreement on the final design.","zh":"意见冲突使最终设计的敲定有所延迟。","note":"clash · 发生冲突；不协调；砰地相撞，发出刺耳的撞击声；冲突； 不协调； 刺耳的撞击声 · a clash of opinions","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1419","en":"The tutor revised the course content after receiving student feedback.","zh":"导师收到学生反馈后修改了课程内容。","note":"content · 满意的；内容；满意[kən'tent]；使满意 · course content","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1420","en":"We watched a helicopter hover above the rocky coastline.","zh":"我们看着一架直升机在岩石海岸上空盘旋。","note":"hover · 翱翔， 盘旋； 逗留在近旁， 徘徊； 彷徨， 犹豫 · hover above","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1421","en":"The researchers selected a random sample of households for interviews.","zh":"研究人员随机抽取了一组家庭进行访谈。","note":"random · 任意的，随机的，随意的；随机， 随意 · a random sample","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1422","en":"Her lively personality quickly made new visitors feel welcome.","zh":"她活泼的个性很快就让新来的访客感到受到欢迎。","note":"personality · 人格； 个性； 名人， 人物 · a lively personality","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1423","en":"The organisers waited for official sanction before announcing the event.","zh":"主办方获得正式批准后才宣布举办这项活动。","note":"sanction · 批准，认可；批准，认可；约束因素，约束力； · official sanction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1424","en":"The guide explains technical terminology using simple diagrams and examples.","zh":"这本指南用简单的图表和例子解释专业术语。","note":"terminology · 专门用语， 术语 · technical terminology","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1425","en":"Drivers must stay alert on this narrow mountain road.","zh":"司机在这条狭窄山路上必须保持警惕。","note":"alert · 警惕的；警戒；警报；警告 · stay alert","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1426","en":"We grow carrots and beans in a small vegetable plot.","zh":"我们在一小块菜地里种胡萝卜和豆子。","note":"plot · 情节； 阴谋； 小块土地 · a vegetable plot","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1427","en":"What can you deduce from the footprints beside the gate?","zh":"你能从门旁的脚印推断出什么？","note":"deduce · 演绎， 推断 · deduce from evidence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1428","en":"An ancient oak tree shades the benches near the church.","zh":"一棵古老的橡树为教堂附近的长椅遮阴。","note":"oak · 橡树， 橡木 · an oak tree","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1429","en":"We agreed to divide the cost equally among six friends.","zh":"我们同意由六位朋友平摊费用。","note":"divide · 分开，分隔；分配，分享；除；分歧， 差异； 分界线， 分水岭 · divide equally","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1430","en":"Contrary to expectations, the outdoor concert attracted a large audience.","zh":"出乎意料，户外音乐会吸引了大批观众。","note":"contrary · 相反的；相反 · contrary to expectations","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1431","en":"The library created a digital archive of local newspapers.","zh":"图书馆建立了一个当地报纸的数字档案库。","note":"digital · 数码的， 数字的 · digital archive","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1432","en":"Opening a beach café in winter seemed a risky gamble.","zh":"冬天开一家海滩咖啡馆似乎是一场风险很大的冒险。","note":"gamble · 赌博， 打赌； 投机； 冒险 · a risky gamble","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1433","en":"The study compared pesticide use on farms of different sizes.","zh":"这项研究比较了不同规模农场的农药使用情况。","note":"pesticide · 杀虫剂， 农药 · pesticide use","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1434","en":"The builder requested a detailed specification before estimating the cost.","zh":"建筑商要求先提供详细规格说明，再估算费用。","note":"specification · 〔汽车、建筑、设备等的〕规格说明，明细规范 · a detailed specification","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1435","en":"Please collect your repaired watch from the service counter.","zh":"请到服务柜台领取修好的手表。","note":"counter · 相反地；柜台 · a service counter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1436","en":"The garden uses collected rainwater to conserve drinking water.","zh":"花园利用收集的雨水来节约饮用水。","note":"conserve · 保护； 保存， 储存； 节约 · conserve water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1437","en":"My cousins tease me about always arriving too early.","zh":"表亲们总拿我到得太早这件事开玩笑。","note":"tease · 逗乐，奚落，戏弄；强求；揶揄， 戏弄， 取笑； 逗弄者， 取笑者 · tease a friend","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1438","en":"The survey asked front-line staff about their daily challenges.","zh":"这项调查询问了一线员工每天面临的困难。","note":"front-line · 前线的； 第一线的 · front-line staff","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1439","en":"Please fill in this form before collecting your visitor badge.","zh":"领取访客证之前，请填写这张表。","note":"form · 形成， 出现；形式；外形；表格 · fill in a form","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1440","en":"Better time management helped her finish assignments without late nights.","zh":"更好的时间管理让她不用熬夜就能完成作业。","note":"management · 管理； 处理 · time management","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1441","en":"Roll the cardboard into a hollow cylinder for the model.","zh":"把硬纸板卷成一个空心圆筒，用来制作模型。","note":"cylinder · 圆柱体； 圆筒； 汽缸 · a hollow cylinder","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1442","en":"I need to renew my library membership before borrowing again.","zh":"再次借书前，我需要续办图书馆会员资格。","note":"renew · 重新开始； 恢复； 更换， 更新； 续借 · renew a membership","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1443","en":"She earned a promotion after successfully managing the relocation project.","zh":"她成功管理搬迁项目后获得了晋升。","note":"promotion · 提升， 晋级； 促进， 增进； 发起， 发扬； 宣传， 推销 · earn a promotion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1444","en":"The coordinator will assign each volunteer a specific task.","zh":"协调员将为每位志愿者分配一项具体任务。","note":"assign · 指派， 分配； 指定 · assign a task","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1445","en":"I stopped at a cash machine to withdraw some money.","zh":"我在自动取款机前停下，取了一些现金。","note":"withdraw · 收回； 撤退； 缩回， 退出； 提取 · withdraw money","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1446","en":"A white feather floated gently onto the surface of the pond.","zh":"一片白色羽毛轻轻飘落在池塘水面。","note":"feather · 羽毛， 翎毛 · a white feather","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-16:s1447","en":"The abandoned cinema has stood empty for over a decade.","zh":"这家废弃电影院已经空置十多年了。","note":"decade · 十年， 十年期 · over a decade","recordings":[]},{"i